Rediancie: {
	SpawnInfo: A bizarre crystal that empowers itself through erratic red energy.
	Despawn: Rediancie retreated underground
}

BabyIceDragon: {
	SpawnInfo: This newly hatched ice dragon cannot yet fully control the power of ice magic. After defeating the Eye of Cthulhu, an Ice Dragon Egg will appear at the center of the Ice Dragon Nest.
	Despawn: The Baby Ice Dragon ran away
}

SlimeEmperor: {
	SpawnInfo: A great gel leader with a very high status among slimes. According to records, only one emperor is born among every 100 Slime Kings. Perhaps it could be called "Supreme Emperor - Slime King".
	Despawn: The Slime Emperor returns to its kingdom
}

NightmarePlantera: {
	SpawnInfo: The Nightmare has taken over the body of the once-defeated Plantera, transforming into a powerful nightmare deity, or perhaps she could be called "Dream Realm Master - Plantera".
	Despawn: The dream dissipated
}

Bloodiancie: {
	SpawnInfo: A Rediancie that, after absorbing the blood moon's energy, can create even larger explosions. It could also be called "Blood Curse - Rediancie".
	Despawn: The Bloodiancie retreated back to hell.
}

ThunderveinDragon: {
	SpawnInfo: An thunder wyvern that harness and control powerful thunder magic.
	Despawn: The Thundervein Wyvern left like lightning.
}

ZacurrentDragon: {
	SpawnInfo: A Thundervein dragon that has long lived in high-energy thunderclouds, mastering the overloaded state. You could call it "Zacurrent · Thundervein Dragon".
	Despawn: The Zacurrent dragon left like lightning.
}
